Vendored OCPP JSON schemas
===========================

The JSON schema files under schemas/v201/, schemas/v16/base/ and schemas/v16/security/
are copyright the Open Charge Alliance (OCA) and are part of the published OCPP 2.0.1
and OCPP 1.6 specifications.

These files are redistributed here exactly as published by OCA, under the terms of the
Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivatives 4.0 International Public License
(CC BY-ND 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nd/4.0/

Every file in these three directories is byte-identical to OCA's own distribution
archive. Nothing here has been reformatted, reordered, re-encoded, or otherwise
modified — not even a trailing newline. Any correction this project needs to a
schema's declared constraints is implemented in this project's own Go source code
(never by editing a file in this tree); see PATCHES.md for the standing rule and its
guard test.

