Verifying and re-obtaining these files
---------------------------------------

schemas/SHA256SUMS lists the sha256 of every vendored file. From the repository root:

    shasum -a 256 -c schemas/SHA256SUMS

scripts/fetch-schemas.sh can verify the vendored tree offline (--check), compare it
against a fresh download from OCA (--verify-remote), or rebuild it from scratch
(--refresh). Run it with --help for details.
